window.products.push({"id":687164,"name":"Dr. Vranjes – Milano 500 ml Diffuser + Double Pack of White Sticks (3 Pieces Bundle) – Luxury Home Fragrance, Made in Italy, Main Scent: Patchouli, Pe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":156.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sODVYx62L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[A SENSUAL FRAGRANCE] Milano fragrance embodies an explosion of sensuality. The intense notes of patchouli, reinvigorated with pepper and sandalwood mix with the sparkling edge of cedar recounting the secret beauty unknown to most. [PAOLO VRANJES MASTER PERFUMER IN FLORENCE] Florentine craftsmanship together with the sophisticated alchemy of the Master Perfumer Dr. Paolo Vranjes bring to life unique fragrances that evoke luxury and comfort. [UNIQUE OLFACTORY EXPERIENCE] Inspired by the scent of the finest Tuscan red wines, the Rosso Nobile fragrance brings an enchanting atmosphere to your living room, providing an elegant and authentic sensory experience. [EXCLUSIVE ITALIAN DESIGN] Each fragrance is kept within an elegant piece designed after the octagonal shape of Brunelleschi’s dome in Florence, one of the most famous architectural works in the world. [HANDMADE GLASS IN TUSCANY] The glass bottles used for the Dr. Vranjes fragrance diffusers are handmade by Tuscan artisans using traditional techniques. Their brilliance, similar to crystal, allows you to appreciate the chromatic intensity each fragrance has to offer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sODVYx62L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"V DR. VRANJES","source_asin":"B09TFZ3TH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TFZ3TH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TFZ3TH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
