window.products.push({"id":687266,"name":"Stainless Steel Insulated Can Cooler by My Booze Butler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715BEgEW+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Koozies For Cans Or Bottles Keeps Your Beverage Cold Til The Last Drop - Have you been searching for a beer or beverage koozie that really works and actually keeps your beverage cold? - Did you find one but it was way more expensive than you'd like to pay? And besides it won't fit that well in your vehicle cup holder? - How many beverages have you tossed because they got warm while you were visiting with your friends? Dang! - And does your slim line can or your bottled beverage just bounce around in your old koozies? Our Boozie Koozie by My Booze Butler Saves The Day And The Drink. - With its 18/8 stainless steel insulated double wall design, it's your go-to for keeping your beer nice and cold til the last drop and at a price you can afford. It's our motto....'the butler you can afford'. - We include a complimentary bottle sock for that slim line can or bottle which makes a nice snug fit AND provides extra insulation to boot! (Not that you need it) - Fits most vehicle cup holders-we haven't yet found one that it doesn't fit. - It is a perfect grip size that both men and women comment on. - One caveat...your friends will try to jack it from you so beware. Amazon Buyers Love And Trust That My Booze Butler Products Meet Their Quality of Standards and Are Always Backed by Our Satisfaction Guarantee. Get Your Special Pricing Today by clicking the 'Add To Cart' Button Now. And Since You're In The Buying Mood, Get One For Your Friend, Assuring That He/She Will Leave Yours Alone. Our Boozie Koozie Makes a Great Gift! Remember....Never Drink And Drive...Alcohol, That Is. Cheers.....","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715BEgEW+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Booze Butler","source_asin":"B01EM5Y73O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EM5Y73O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EM5Y73O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687267,"name":"Xbeauty 33\" Electric Fireplace Insert Freestanding Built in Fireplace Heater Multicolor LED Flame with Timer,Touch Screen, Remote Control, 750W-1500W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91L5e43HZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Open Door Screen with Mesh Curtain】32\"x 22.16\" viewing area,1.4\" wide frame, amazing experience of watching with traditional brickwork panel and life like resin logs. Front mesh screen curtain makes the fireplace more realistic. The enlargement of portrait fireplace viewing windows not only creates a focal center for your living space, but also creates a sense of elegance and prestige. 【Adjustable Multi-Color Flame】Realistic flame effects, built-in atmosphere lamp, 5 flame speeds & 5 flame brightness, 3 flame and ember bed colors lighting options. 100% energy saving LED technology. You can set the shine and the color of flames and choose between a soft or an intense blaze via remote control or touch screen 【Electric Heater & No Heat Fireplace Decor】2 Heating Setting, Energy Saving and Safe. 750w &1500w infrared front air heating system can radiate soft warm air airflow, heating up to 400 square feet room. This fireplace can be used as a heater or decorative no heat fireplace. If you don’t need to heat up your room, simply turn off the heat and leave the flames dancing. The attractive display is soothing and enjoyable to watch. 【Dimensions】34\" (W) X 25.98\" (H) X 8.74\" (D); Recommended insert size of fireplace opening 35.91\"-36.18\" (W) x 25.43\"-25.59\"(H) x 7.87\"-9.84\"(D). 5100BTUS,12.5AMPS,plug-in 120v. This traditional looking electric fireplace insert can be fully recessed into existing old fireplace opening by sliding it into the empty fireplace box space or directly installing it into a wall, a mantle or just freestanding. 【Customer Service】Free replacement for installation problems, damage and missing parts within 1 year. Replacement & refund within 1 month.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91L5e43HZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xbeauty","source_asin":"B07S61Q24M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S61Q24M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S61Q24M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
