window.products.push({"id":687270,"name":"Space Heater,Portable Electric Heater with Adjustable Thermostat,1200W/600W Safe and Quiet Oscillating Ceramic Heater,Tilt and Over Heat Portection,Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SjizxsOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choose our heater, so that you do not feel cold throughout the winter！ 1. The space heater comes with double protection. When the heater is tilted forward or backward, it will automatically turn off the heater. Therefore, please put it on a flat surface to use the space heater. 2. The space heater offers a choice of cool/warm/hot air. To activate the heater, turn the knob to the fan position for cool air, turn the knob to the second from the right for warm air - low power, and the third from the right for hot air - maximum power. Also the relative signs indicate the different modes of oscillation function. 3. Portable countertop space heater.It's so easy and convenient for you to move from one place to another. Small and portable design, so that the space heater can provide you with warmth anywhere. 4. The space heater delivers a comfortable temperature that will let you sleep better at night! It's ideal for reading, working, listening to music, watching TV, doing homework, taking a nap or sleeping at night, and our low-noise space heaters won't disturb you, your kids or your neighbors. 5. The space heater is able to heat up quickly. It doesn't even take three seconds for your office or bedroom to be comfortable. It is more energy efficient compared to other appliances and can save you a lot of money on your electricity bill in winter! HOW TO USE ⚓ Place the space heater on a firm, level surface free from obstructions,and at least 3 ft. (0.9m) away from any wall or combustible material. ⚓ With the selection switch in the OFF \"0\" position, plug the space heater into a polarized 120V outlet. ⚓ To turn the space heater on, selection switch while turning it clockwise to the desired position (for 1200W, or 0 for 600W). The power light will illuminate. ⚓ Turn the selection switch to OFF \"0\" and unplug the space heater when you are finished using it. ⚓ Turn the left selection switch一Provides 1200 watts of heat output operation with oscillation ⚓ Turn the second left selection switch一Provides 600 watts of heat output operation with oscillation ⚓ Turn the left triple selection switch一 Fan only operation for cooling comfort with oscillation Specifications Weight: 2.6 Ib Voltage: 120V Frequency: 50Hz Output Power (W): 1200W Dimensions: 6.5in*6.5in*11.5in Notice Don’t place it on a soft surface such as a bed and carpet a, do not use in wet placed such as bathrooms. Keep away from flammable and explosive materials. Cleaning 1.Turn the space heater OFF \"0\" and unplug it. Allow it to cool. 2.Use a dry cloth to clean the extemal surfaces of the space heater.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SjizxsOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LooQoo","source_asin":"B0BPRW4618","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPRW4618","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPRW4618","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
