window.products.push({"id":687279,"name":"Granite Mortar and Pestle Set - Large 2 Cup Stone Grinder Guacamole Bowl and 6 Inch Pestle - Perfect for Crushing and Grinding Herbs and Spices to Max","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c-5QtixwL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Best Way to Release Flavors & Aromas: If you want to take your cooking skills and meals to the next level, then this pestle and mortar set is a must have; By crushing, mashing, and grinding herbs, spices, and plants by hand, you'll release bigger, bolder flavors and more vibrant colors. You’ll Be Amazed How Easy It Is to Use & Clean: Don't worry, your hand and arm won't be on fire from using our guacamole bowls and pestles; Our mortar’s rough interior and stable base coupled with the smooth, rounded 6 inch size pestle make grinding a cinch; To clean, use dishwashing soap and water and wipe with a clean cloth to prevent water stains. Created From Unpolished, Natural Granite: This guacamole mortar and pestle has an old world look and feel; Each grinder is carefully crafted from heavy duty, unpolished, natural granite stone; The mortar has a thick, nonporous interior with a 2 cup capacity, giving you plenty of room to work your magic. Will Not Damage Your Expensive Countertops: A non slip, anti scratch silicone bottom cover comes with every order; So, when you're using our large heavy duty mortar and pestle granite set, you won't have to be concerned with scratching or damaging your countertops. Functional, High Performance Kitchen Products: We want to provide our customers with high quality products that every kitchen and cook needs, so they can serve delicious culinary experiences for their friends and family; We're confident in the quality of this set and proudly back it with a 1 Year Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c-5QtixwL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchazeli","source_asin":"B09DD51ZXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DD51ZXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DD51ZXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
