window.products.push({"id":687454,"name":"Bobkona Sectional Sofa Set, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":951.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gnDBxKCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This stylish modern sofa offers spacious seating that contains a chaise extension on the left-facing side for you to stretch your legs and have a relaxing moment after a long day. The sofa also comes with a matching color ottoman with storage space, and you can tuck away extra pillows, small blankets, and even chess board while keeping the living space neat and clean. With the pop-up and chic pillows that mix and match with the American traditional furniture, your home is just as vibrant as it can be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gnDBxKCyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poundex","source_asin":"B0BQ6TNX6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ6TNX6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ6TNX6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687455,"name":"Feng Shui Resin Money Frog (Three Legged Toad/Wealth Frog) Figure Home Office Decoration(Bronze, L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HUsWsxRlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lore of the Money Frog The money frog also called the three-legged toad or money toad comes from Chinese folklore. According to the legend, a wife of one of the eight immortals stole the elixir of immortality and drank it, turning her into a toad. Instead of two hind legs, the toad has the tail of the tadpole. Frogs and toads are associated with water, which is symbolic of wealth. It is common for a money frog to have a coin in its mouth, as an offering for the owner or the household where the frog resides. Placing a Money Frog Traditionally, the money frog is placed in a home's feng shui money area or wealth position. This is usually the corner of the home that is diagonally opposite the entry door and is known as the primary wealth position. The corner opposite (straight across from) the primary wealth position is the secondary wealth position. In addition to placing a money frog in the money area, you can also place a second money frog close to the front door. In this case, it's important to position the frog so that it looks inside the house rather than facing out through the entrance. You can also place a money frog so that it faces your Money and Success feng shui direction. Where Not to Place a Money Frog Always position your feng shui money frog in a respectful way, so it is best not to place your money frog directly on the floor, but rather on a raised surface, such as a cabinet. The cabinet (or other surface) should be placed against a wall for backing support. It should not be in the middle of a room, under a window, or in a hallway or traffic area. Also, it is best not to place a feng shui money frog in your bedroom or in your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HUsWsxRlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZenBless","source_asin":"B07HNKBL1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNKBL1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNKBL1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
