window.products.push({"id":687672,"name":"Empire Art Direct Romantic Dance Metal, Hand Painted Primo Mixed Media Iron Sculpture, Decor,Ready to Hang,Living Room, Bedroom ＆ Office 3D Wall Art, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":195.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918Yrw1RnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Empire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. Ead has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life.3D iron wall sculpture by Primo. Each piece involves the artist's mastery as many individual pieces of iron are cut, and welded by hand. Then they are handpainted to the artist's taste to create an exclusive work of mixed media.In visual art, mixed media is an artwork in which more than one medium or material has been employed. This piece employs Primo's master of ironwork and hand painting. The expressive uniqueness of Primo's wall art will enhance any environment with a one of a kind, individual work of art.Each piece is inspected and certified by the artist as an original work of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918Yrw1RnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B07MT5WC5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MT5WC5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MT5WC5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687673,"name":"Polish Pottery Ceramika Boleslawiec, 0727/162, Mercedes Divided Platter, 10 3/4 Inches in Diameter, Royal Blue Patterns with Blue Pansy Flower Motif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lLWXVrmLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Unikat Signature Polish Pottery is a Limited production from a small factory near Boleslawiec, Poland. The Model 0727 Pattern 162 created using Boleslawiec White Clay molded and painted by hand according to Traditional Methods with Styles of Design and Color influenced by Contemporary shapes and dyes. The beautiful Mercedes Divided Platter has a Royal Blue rim accented by spiral buds and blue Pansy flower petals surrounded by leaves and wisps of green grass. The Divided Platter created with a unique original design and formation of the mold followed by drying, pre-baking at 1562° Fahrenheit then Glazed, and fired at 2282° Fahrenheit is Scratch and Chip resistant, Lead free, Oven; Microwave; Dishwasher and Freezer safe without losing the beautiful colors and textures. The measurements* in Inches are 1 1/2 high by 10 3/4 long by 10 3/4 wide. *Note; No machines used for Molding or Pattern stamping therefore there may be small variations in Measurements and Patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lLWXVrmLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polish Pottery Ceramika Boleslawiec","source_asin":"B006BE78E0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006BE78E0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006BE78E0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687674,"name":"Suncourt Door Frame Fan for Maximizing Indoor Air Circulation - Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATSj8xulS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After opening the window in the attempt of getting some relief from the heat of your home, you know that you need to figure something out when the drops of sweat stream down your face. The best thing to do is to create a cross-draft, and what better way to attain this than Suncourt Manufacturing doorway booster fan. Designed to fit in any doorway corner, it gently circulates air from room-to-room, creating the ideal temperature conditions. This fan comes in an attractive brown finish to match your decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ATSj8xulS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suncourt","source_asin":"B00487NDQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00487NDQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00487NDQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687675,"name":"GTMONSTER Racing Style Video Gaming Chair, Reclining Ergonomic Leather Office Computer Game Chair, Swivel Gaming Chairs, in Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815cNAi5wTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Comfortable seat】a racing game chair that provides luxury and comfort, whether for intense game conversations, climbing to the top of the league table, or long working hours. GTMONSTER is committed to creating the best game chairs for professional players. Choose us and improve your game experience! Dimensions: 20.86\"(L) x 21.26\"(W) x 48.82\"-51.97\"(H); Sitting Area Dimensions: 16''(L) x 19.68''(W); Maximum Weight Capacity: 300 pounds. ✔【Ergonomic design】to prevent repetitive stress, it is important to have the correct ergonomic posture when sitting for a long time, a sturdy metal frame helps promote a comfortable sitting position, and the seat is adjustable to ensure that each user of different heights can adjust the chair to keep you comfortable after playing or working for a long time. The thick back and seat make this chair more comfortable. ✔【Freely adjustable】 the height of the armrest and seat is adjustable; find the best position by raising or lowering the chair and tilting between 90 and 170 degrees . The soft cushioned armrest rotates with the recliner. A complete 360-degree rotation can achieve dynamic motion. 5-point base built with heavy duty; removable headrest and waist cushion. ✔【Selected materials】high-density molded foam, more comfortable, resilient, long service life; smooth PU leather, skin-friendly and wear-resistant, increased seat cushions as well as waist and headrest provide extra support and comfort. Heavy foundation and nylon smooth rollers with excellent stability and maneuverability. ✔【Wide range of applications】GTMONSTER game chairs are ideal for work, study and games. Watch TV, work and rest, it will make your space more modern, more elegant, and make you more comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815cNAi5wTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GTMONSTER","source_asin":"B08FB4WZV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FB4WZV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FB4WZV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
