window.products.push({"id":687714,"name":"Milliard Kids Vanity Set with Mirror and Stool, Beauty Makeup Vanity Table and Chair Set for Toddlers and Kids, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S0CIxYRgL._AC_SL1292_.jpg","description":"Kids will love admiring their style with a real vanity set sized just for them! New hairdos, lavish jewelry, perfect makeup, and shiny nail polish are just a handful of accessories kids can try out When makeover time is over, makeup, brushes, jewelry, and other items can be stashed in the built-in drawer or kept neatly on the ample desktop. Both the table and stool have been strength and safety tested to conform with astm F2613 consumer standards, because there's nothing fashionable about accidents! Rounded corners, shatter resistant mirror and drawer stopper; Safety is our priority. Even their room will look fashionable with the ornate, pink furniture in their decor. Great as a homework desk too! Vanity set measures 25.5x15.75x42 with a seat height of 13.5 inch. Assembly time avg. 20-30 min, tools included. Recommended for ages 3-9 years. Made with high quality materials and upgraded packaging. Our goal is that you should receive a perfect product, if there are any issues please contact us..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S0CIxYRgL._AC_SL1292_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milliard","source_asin":"B07F1BJMFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F1BJMFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F1BJMFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":687715,"name":"Tom Douglas by Pinzon Dexter-Russell Stainless-Steel Slotted Fish Turner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rk45PvZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Award-winning chef-restaurateur Tom Douglas, Dexter-Russell, and Amazon.com introduce a line of multi-functional products that will inspire home chefs and build confidence in the kitchen. This 6-1/2-inch fish turner, manufactured by Dexter-Russell, combines a professional design and high-grade materials, making it ideal for everyday use. The stainless-steel slotted turner is super flexible to get under the most delicate fish and even large crab cakes. Signature slots allow excess liquids to drain back into the pan as you lift. An attractive walnut handle is secured to the tang with two brass compression rivets. Dexter-Russell has been manufacturing tools and cutlery since 1818, creating products that are designed, built, and tested to be people-friendly and kitchen-tough. This spatula is made in the USA and carries a limited lifetime warranty. To maintain the beauty of the tool, hand washing is recommended. Tom's Tips This spatula is flexible but still sturdy--it's perfect for flipping the most delicate fish fillets. This spatula is flexible but still sturdy--it's perfect for flipping the most delicate fish fillets. Although the turner is designed for fish, it's actually very handy for any sauté-pan flipping duty. Although the turner is designed for fish, it's actually very handy for any sauté-pan flipping duty. About Tom Douglas Tom Douglas is an American chef, restaurateur, and writer. He is well known for helping to define Northwest cuisine and igniting the Seattle restaurant scene, winning the James Beard Award for Best Northwest Chef in 1994. Since 1989, Tom has opened five of Seattle’s most popular restaurants: Dahlia Lounge; the Greek-inspired Lola; Serious Pie pizzeria; Palace Kitchen; and Pike Place Market’s iconic seafood restaurant, Etta’s. He also owns Dahlia Bakery, famous for its Triple Coconut Cream Pie. Tom is the author of Tom Douglas' Seattle Kitchen , named Best American Cookbook by the James Beard Foundation, Tom's Big Dinners , and I Love Crab Cakes! He bested Masaharu Morimoto in an episode of Iron Chef America and was named 2008 Bon Appétit Restaurateur of the Year. Tom is currently working with Amazon.com on an exclusive line of kitchen and dining products, aimed at building confidence in the kitchen. Visit the Tom Douglas by Pinzon Store to browse his full line of Tom Douglas by Pinzon products, discover Tom's all-time favorite cookbooks, and find delicious recipes to make with his kitchen products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rk45PvZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tom Douglas","source_asin":"B0028ADMIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028ADMIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028ADMIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
