window.products.push({"id":687774,"name":"Nouhaus Wave Ergonomic Office Chair. Rolling Mesh Office Chair with Lumbar Support and Adjustable Arms. Comfortable Computer Chair, Home Office Desk C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LSI9mNbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Small Chair, Big Ambition: You’d be forgiven for thinking Wave is a basic task chair. After all, it’s incredibly minimalist. But inside is a buoyant frameless backrest, 3 ‘wave-like’ spinal contours, flip-up armrests, supportive seat, adjustable height, tilt tension and recline. Next-level Simple. Cool Chairs That Breathe: Soft mesh optimizes airflow to avoid sweating and sticking while supporting your back in frameless weightlessness. The seat is soft and cushioned with high density foam and covered with breathable ElastoFabric making it a comfy desk chair for long hours of sitting. A Decorators Dream: A slate gray desk chair or sleek black office chair without bulky plastic frame is not only weightless, but also timeless - letting you change the personality in your space many times around the same small office chair. Wave goes beyond ergonomics, with freedom to change it up. Room for Movement: The wavy full length backrest - with contoured neck, thoracic and lumbar support - fits everyone from 5ft to 6ft. Office chair flip up arms (90deg) let you lean in to work, lean back to admire your effort, and push your arm chair in at the end of the day in a grand space saving finale! Silently Adjustable: Surf your Wave as often you wish. This modern desk chair comes with Tilt Tension, 122deg Recline and Class-4 Hydraulic Seat Lift (20 to 23in). It’s a smooth 360deg swivel desk chair with aluminum alloy base and silent PU hollow casters. It really is a small chair big on ambition - try it and see.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LSI9mNbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nouhaus","source_asin":"B0BT7LMR6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT7LMR6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT7LMR6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
