window.products.push({"id":687811,"name":"Decorative Wood -Salad -Bowl Set with Matching Lid & Servers , Large Wood Fruit Bowl in a 4 piece Wooden Salad Bowl Set - Handmade with Mangowood - 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hE2J9lVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📏Measurements: This is a 4 piece wood salad bowls set which includes 1 large salad bowl, a matching lid to cover your freshly made salad, a serving spoon and fork. Bowl measures 12 inch in diameter and 3.5 inch height. Matching servers measure - 11 inch. These have been contoured for easy tossing and serving. The matching lid features two small cut outs so that you can stand your serving utensils inside the bowl. No more trying to figure out where to place the serving utensils. 🤏Natural And Unique: 100% Hand crafted from rich mango wood making each piece unique. Stunning designs that will impress your guests. Handmade artisian wooden salad bowls which may vary slightly due to natural wood construction. 🌿Countless Uses: Simple and elegant wooden salad bowl set with multiple-use, naturally suited to everyday use. Perfect for salad, pasta, bread, fruit, cereal or movie-night popcorn and even as artful display or a kitchen centrepiece decoration. Suitable for inside and outside dinning. Table-ready and gorgeous to look at! An excellent choice for the table, buffet or potluck offering. Have your salad ready to go in these stylish serving bowls with mango wood lid. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐Protection For Life: Our contemporary salad bowls are built with pride to be durable yet light weight salad bowls. 100% Customer Dedication - If you aren't happy, we'll fix it! Our #1 priority is you. The lacquer top-coat protects the wood and aids easy cleanup. Hand wash only - wipe clean with a wet soft cloth and dry thoroughly after every time use. Wipe outer wood with oil for daily maintaining for lifetime use. 🎁Perfect Gift And Present Idea: Our large salad sets are a gorgeous decorative addition for Holiday parties. Give the gift of freshness and elegance. Willow and Moore salad bowl set will make the perfect housewarming gift, ideal gift for Wedding registry, Mother’s Day gift, gifts for mum. Our salad bowl set would make for a very thoughtful Christmas present or Thanksgiving present for your wife. These chic wood salad bowls are an accent piece for any home or restaurant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hE2J9lVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow and Moore","source_asin":"B08H1D7W54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H1D7W54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H1D7W54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
