window.products.push({"id":687813,"name":"LACKINGONE LED Ribbon Lights for Decorations - 32.8ft (2X16.4ft) 100 LED IP44 Waterproof Fairy Lights Battery Operated with Remote & Timer for Childre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bkXaQyxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【Versatile LED Ribbon String Lights】🎁 LACKINGONE LED Ribbon String Lights are perfect for creating a romantic atmosphere during seasonal celebrations. They are especially suitable for Mother's Day, Children's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Parties, and weddings. Use them to enhance patios, gardens, rooms, and even ladders. 🎄【Remote Control & Timer with 8 Lighting Modes】🎁 Easily control the Seasonal LED Ribbon Lights with the included remote control. Choose from 8 lighting modes, including combination, in-wave, sequential, slow glow, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, and steady-on. The timer function allows you to set a specific time for the lights to automatically turn on or off. With the press of a button, you can also adjust the brightness or power on/off the lights. 🎄【Flexible DIY Decoration】🎁 The soft and bendable copper wire of the fairy ribbon string lights allows for easy customization. Shape it into bows, love symbols, Christmas tree decorations, or any other creative designs to celebrate Mother's Day, Children's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Parties, and weddings. Let your imagination run wild and create a memorable and joyful atmosphere with these LED ribbon fairy lights. 🎄【Battery Operated & Waterproof】🎁 The LED ribbon lights are powered by 3 AA batteries (not included). The safe and reliable 3.0V output voltage ensures peace of mind. Made with IP44 waterproof material, these fairy lights can be used both indoors and outdoors, making them perfect for areas without a power supply. The compact battery case is easy to hide and features an on/off switch. (Note: The wires and LEDs are waterproof, but the battery case should not be submerged in water.) 🎄【Package Contents】🎁 Each set of Seasonal LED Ribbon Lights includes 2 X 16.4ft (100 LED) ribbon string lights, a battery box (batteries not included), and a remote control (batteries included). The total length of the lights is 35ft/11m, with 32ft/10m of LED lights and a 1m/3.2ft extension cord. The distance between each bulb is 10cm, and the width of the ribbon is 5cm. 🎅【Important Reminder】🎁 In case of any damage to the LED Ribbon lights, please discontinue use to prevent potential short-circuits. We value your satisfaction, so if you have any issues or concerns, please reach out to our customer service team. We are here to assist you and offer replacements or refunds if necessary. Celebrate Mother's Day, Children's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Parties, and weddings in style with our LED Ribbon Lights!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bkXaQyxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LACKINGONE","source_asin":"B0BB19C9HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-687813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB19C9HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB19C9HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
